{"type":"message","id":"87f6b64b","parentId":"e1f2e154","timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:49:51.358Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/zcg/.openclaw/media/inbound/2ef22e00-7e2f-4824-b1d1-5fc5aeffba09.ogg (audio/ogg; codecs=opus) | /Users/zcg/.openclaw/media/inbound/2ef22e00-7e2f-4824-b1d1-5fc5aeffba09.ogg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-11 00:49:42 GMT+8] Feishu[investment] DM from ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0: {\"file_key\":\"file_v3_00vm_c78a6d09-1115-4134-9e11-1c3dbe92411g\",\"duration\":6000}\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5430f499b46cb3669ce3057ffce\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-11 00:49 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\"\n}\n```\n\n{\"file_key\":\"file_v3_00vm_c78a6d09-1115-4134-9e11-1c3dbe92411g\",\"duration\":6000}"}],"timestamp":1773161391357}}
{"type":"message","id":"a806846c","parentId":"87f6b64b","timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:49:59.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户发送了一段语音消息（6 秒长的 ogg 音频文件）。我需要：\n\n1. 识别这是一个语音输入\n2. 转录或理解语音内容\n3. 根据内容做出响应\n\n但我目前没有音频转录工具可用。让我检查一下我的工具列表...我没有看到专门的语音转录工具（如 `speech_to_text` 或类似的）。\n\n我应该通知用户我收到了语音消息，但需要他们提供文本转录或使用其他方式来处理这个请求。或者，我可以询问他们语音中的内容是什么。\n\n等等，让我再检查一下。在消息工具的描述中，我看到有音频处理的能力吗？没有。我的工具中没有语音识别功能。\n\n我应该礼貌地告诉用户我收到了语音消息，但我需要文本形式的内容才能理解和响应。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"你好！我收到了一段 6 秒的语音消息，但目前我还没有语音识别的能力。\n\n请用文字告诉我你想要什么帮助，我会立即处理 👍\n\n例如：\n- 需要做什么工作？\n- 有什么问题需要解决？\n- 要启动哪个工作流？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":403,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":21992,"totalTokens":22405,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773161391358}}
