{"type":"message","id":"4f306413","parentId":"5f2d53be","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:07:13.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我通过飞书（Feishu）给他发个消息。我需要用 message 工具来做这件事。\n\n从之前的对话context看，用户在飞书的dingding-dev频道中，sender_id是 `ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03`。\n\n我应该向这个用户发送一条消息。使用 message 工具，指定：\n- action: send\n- channel: feishu（或者叫 feishu）\n- target: 可以用用户 ID 或者频道名\n- message: 一条简单的测试消息\n\n让我查看 message 工具的参数...\n- action: \"send\" ✓\n- message: 要发送的文本 ✓\n- channel: \"feishu\" (需要验证正确的名字)\n- target: 可以是用户ID或频道名\n\n根据之前的系统提示，是通过 Feishu[dingding-dev] DM 来的，所以应该是向这个用户的DM发送。我可以用 target 指向用户ID或者直接用频道名。\n\n看起来应该用 `target` 和 `channel` 参数。让我发送一条测试消息。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_018QJ7wVEu6CccQjtY55Vk9B","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03","message":"✅ 飞书消息测试通过！\n\n我是盯钉喵开发助理。这条消息证明我可以通过飞书和你沟通。\n\n有什么我能帮你的吗？🐱‍💻"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":544,"cacheRead":20353,"cacheWrite":8895,"totalTokens":29802,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773162426542}}
