{"type":"message","id":"10445c8c","parentId":"4d304500","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:14:05.831Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎉 **成功！飞书频道现在是 OK 状态！** \n\n```\n│ Feishu   │ ON      │ OK     │ configured · accounts 3/3\n```\n\n这意味着：\n- ✅ 飞书插件已成功加载\n- ✅ 3 个账户已配置（dingding-dev、investment、default）\n- ✅ 频道状态正常\n\n现在让我测试一下能否通过飞书发送消息给你："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01PEXenaYYqxTJEfXZVc178r","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","message":"🎉 飞书频道已修复！\n\n✅ 问题已解决：\n1. 安装了缺失的依赖（@sinclair/typebox）\n2. 启用了飞书插件\n3. 网关已重启并加载插件\n\n现在你可以通过飞书和我通信了！","channel":"feishu","target":"ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":3,"output":349,"cacheRead":76425,"cacheWrite":398,"totalTokens":77175,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773162839306}}
