{"type":"message","id":"31365fe8","parentId":"54243b03","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:14:18.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 总结 📋\n\n我已经**成功修复飞书频道问题**！以下是执行过程：\n\n### 🔴 **根本原因**\n飞书插件在启动时缺少依赖库 `@sinclair/typebox`，导致插件无法加载。\n\n### ✅ **解决步骤**\n\n1. **诊断** — 运行 `openclaw status` 和日志检查，识别出 `Error: Cannot find module '@sinclair/typebox'`\n\n2. **修复依赖** — \n   - 进入飞书插件目录 `~/.openclaw/extensions/feishu`\n   - 临时移除 `devDependencies` 中的 workspace 引用（`npm install` 的兼容性问题）\n   - 运行 `npm install` 安装所有依赖\n\n3. **重启网关** — \n   - 停止并重启 OpenClaw Gateway 服务\n   - 让新进程加载已安装的依赖\n\n4. **启用插件** — \n   - 通过 `gateway config.patch` 将飞书添加到 `plugins.allow` 白名单\n   - 确保 `plugins.entries.feishu.enabled = true`\n   - 网关自动重启完成配置生效\n\n### 📊 **最终状态**\n```\nFeishu   │ ON      │ OK     │ configured · accounts 3/3\n```\n\n飞书频道现在完全可用，支持 3 个账户（dingding-dev、investment、default）！🐱‍💻"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":1,"output":437,"cacheRead":77216,"cacheWrite":250,"totalTokens":77904,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773162850566}}
