{"type":"message","id":"78377e41","parentId":"5bdef2a6","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:14:38.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求给他发个消息到飞书。现在飞书频道已经修复好了，应该能正常工作。\n\n根据日志信息，用户来自 `dingding-dev` 账户（sender_id: ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03）。\n\n我需要通过 message 工具发送消息。让我用正确的参数。\n\n根据之前的尝试，target 应该是用户ID。让我指定 channel 为 feishu，target 为用户ID，然后发送消息。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01W8xPTLPQdKPMQkWqS9pcVX","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","to":"ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03","message":"🎉 飞书消息测试成功！\n\n✅ **问题已完全解决**\n\n**执行步骤：**\n1. ✓ 诊断出缺失依赖：@sinclair/typebox\n2. ✓ 安装飞书插件依赖  \n3. ✓ 重启 OpenClaw 网关\n4. ✓ 启用飞书插件到白名单\n5. ✓ 频道现在状态：**ON · OK**\n\n现在你可以通过飞书和我正常通信了！🐱‍💻"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":448,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":95789,"totalTokens":96247,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773162868267}}
