{"type":"message","id":"64249b54","parentId":"8ce9c973","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:24:36.346Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"检查到你的 MacBook 本地环境，而不是远程的 jxhs 服务器。平台运维巡检需要连接到**生产服务器**。\n\n## 🔍 检查结果\n\n**当前环境**：本地开发机 `周宁远的MacBook Pro`\n- ✅ CPU 负载：3.18（正常）\n- ✅ 磁盘使用率：9%（健康）\n- ✅ OpenClaw 网关：运行正常\n\n**但平台 API 服务检查需要**：\n- 📍 远程服务器（jxhs）的访问权限\n- 🐳 Docker Compose 环境\n- 🗄️ 生产数据库连接\n\n---\n\n## ❓ 确认\n\n你的生产平台是部署在远程服务器（如 jxhs）上吗？如果是：\n\n1. 我需要 SSH 访问权限来进行远程巡检\n2. 或者你可以手动告诉我关键信息（服务器IP、容器状态等）\n\n**或者**，如果这是一个本地开发环境的测试巡检，我可以检查本地 Docker 环境。\n\n你想怎么做？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":2,"output":350,"cacheRead":88109,"cacheWrite":97,"totalTokens":88558,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773163468806}}
{"type":"message","id":"304ed5be","parentId":"64249b54","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:27:48.263Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-11 01:27:47 GMT+8] Feishu[investment] DM from ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0: 可以直接ssh jxhs 别名访问\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b543107d1c0a0b31b8ce9893371c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-11 01:27 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\"\n}\n```\n\n可以直接ssh jxhs 别名访问"}],"timestamp":1773163668261}}
{"type":"message","id":"82fcf191","parentId":"304ed5be","timestamp":"2026-03-10T17:27:57.518Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户说可以直接 ssh jxhs 来访问服务器。这很好。现在我可以按照 PLATFORM_OPS_WORKFLOW.md 中的工作流执行平台巡检。\n\n让我按照工作流的 5 个采集子任务执行：\n1. 子任务 A：主机状态（CPU、内存、磁盘等）\n2. 子任务 B：项目运行状态（Docker 容器、日志等）\n3. 子任务 B.5：Docker 全局统计\n4. 子任务 C：数据库状态\n5. 子任务 D：服务器安全状态\n\n我应该逐步执行这些任务，并将结果写入临时文件，最后生成最终报告。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"完美！👍 现在开始**平台健康巡检**工作流。\n\n## 📊 平台运维巡检工作流启动\n\n我会通过 ssh jxhs 执行 5 个采集子任务，最后生成完整报告。\n\n### 子任务 A：主机状态"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01CUN9t2TwNXidZZJfLjaN9u","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ssh jxhs bash -s << 'EOF'\necho \"=== 🖥️ 主机基础设施状态 ===\"\necho \"\"\necho \"【CPU 负载】\"\nuptime\necho \"\"\necho \"【内存使用】\"\nfree -h | grep Mem\necho \"\"\necho \"【磁盘总览】\"\ndf -h / | awk 'NR==2 {printf \"使用率: %.0f%% (%s/%s)\\n\", $5, $3, $2}'\necho \"\"\necho \"【关键目录体量】\"\ndu -sh /opt/dingding-platform 2>/dev/null || echo \"平台目录未找到\"\ndu -sh /var/lib/docker 2>/dev/null || echo \"Docker 数据目录未找到\"\necho \"\"\necho \"【TOP 大文件（>500MB）】\"\nfind / -type f -size +500M 2>/dev/null | head -5 || echo \"扫描中...\"\nEOF\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":614,"cacheRead":81835,"cacheWrite":7201,"totalTokens":89660,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773163668262}}
