{"type":"message","id":"6edab0ad","parentId":"ff82429c","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:03:39.379Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The system is asking me to save durable memories before session compaction. Let me review what important information from this session should be persisted:\n\n1. **Feishu Plugin Fix** - Successfully diagnosed and fixed the missing @sinclair/typebox dependency\n2. **investment-advisor Setup** - Created the missing workspace directory and fixed the configuration path\n3. **Platform Health Check** - Completed ops-health workflow, found critical disk usage issue (95%)\n4. **Pairing Approvals** - Multiple Feishu user approvals (ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03)\n\nThese are important learnings for future sessions. Let me create a memory file with these findings.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01Hbp94Si1GRwqcy1B5kQgy6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/agents/dingding-assistant/memory/2026-03-11.md","content":"# 工作记忆 - 2026-03-11\n\n## ✅ 完成任务\n\n### 1. Feishu 频道修复\n- **问题**：飞书插件无法加载，报错 `Cannot find module '@sinclair/typebox'`\n- **根本原因**：feishu 扩展的 devDependencies 中有 workspace 引用，npm install 不兼容\n- **解决方案**：\n  1. 移除 `~/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/package.json` 中的 devDependencies workspace 引用\n  2. 运行 `npm install` 安装所有依赖\n  3. 重启 OpenClaw 网关\n  4. 将飞书添加到 `plugins.allow` 白名单\n- **验证**：频道状态现为 `ON · OK · configured · accounts 3/3`\n- **关键文件**：`~/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/package.json`\n\n### 2. investment-advisor 助手修复\n- **问题**：investment-advisor 助手无法工作，提示 access not configured\n- **根本原因**：\n  1. workspace 目录结构未初始化\n  2. 配置中的 workspace 路径错误（指向 `/Users/zcg/.openclaw/workspace/agents/` 而非 `/Users/zcg/.openclaw/agents/`）\n- **解决方案**：\n  1. 创建 `~/.openclaw/agents/investment-advisor/sessions/` 目录\n  2. 修复 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 中的 workspace 路径\n  3. 批准 Feishu 用户配对（pairing code: F8CUN57G, 9MPLAYFE, UZWMDEQU）\n- **验证**：现在两个助手都已注册\n\n### 3. 平台健康巡检（ops-health）\n- **状态**：✅ 完成\n- **关键发现**：\n  - 🔴 **磁盘使用率 95%**（54GB/59GB）- 立即处理\n  - 🔴 **gaccode 容器不健康**\n  - 🔴 **tddatasvr 容器持续重启**\n  - 🟢 数据库健康（10MB + 13MB）\n  - 🟡 防火墙未启用，Docker 端口暴露 0.0.0.0\n  - 🟡 可回收磁盘空间 8GB（镜像 3GB + 卷 1.7GB + 缓存 3.9GB）\n- **报告位置**：`~/workroot/dingding-platform/.agents/skills/ops-health/reports/health_report_20260311_0127.md`\n- **立即行动**：\n  ```bash\n  # 清理磁盘\n  ssh jxhs docker system prune -a --volumes\n  # 修复容器\n  ssh jxhs \"cd /opt/dingding-platform/docker && docker compose restart gaccode-prod\"\n  ssh jxhs \"cd /opt/dingding-platform/docker && docker compose up -d runner-node-prod\"\n  ```\n\n## 📌 系统状态\n\n### 当前活跃\n- dingding-assistant（盯钉喵开发运营助理）- 主活跃\n- investment-advisor（我的理财助手）- 刚修复\n\n### 飞书集成\n- ✅ 飞书插件已加载\n- ✅ 3 个账户已配置（dingding-dev、investment、default）\n- ✅ 用户 ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03 已批准配对\n- ✅ 可通过飞书 DM 访问两个助手\n\n## 🚨 待处理优先事项\n\n1. **磁盘清理**（今天）\n   - 执行 `docker system prune -a --volumes` 释放 8 GB\n   - 验证使用率降低至 < 80%\n\n2. **容器修复**（今天）\n   - 重启 gaccode\n   - 启动 runner-node\n   - 调查 tddatasvr 重启原因\n\n3. **安全加固**（本周）\n   - 启用防火墙\n   - 限制 Docker 端口暴露\n\n## 📝 经验记录\n\n### Feishu 插件依赖问题\n- **症状**：插件加载失败，require stack 错误\n- **根本原因**：package.json 中的 `workspace:*` 引用与 npm 不兼容\n- **预防**：扩展 package.json 需要定期 npm install 验证\n\n### 助手工作目录初始化\n- **症状**：助手在 status 中列出但无法响应\n- **根本原因**：工作目录不存在或配置路径错误\n- **规则**：新增助手时必须确保：\n  1. 目录存在：`~/.openclaw/agents/<agent-id>/sessions/`\n  2. 会话文件存在：`sessions.json`（可为空数组）\n  3. 配置路径正确\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":1681,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":104470,"totalTokens":106161,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773165794108}}
