{"type":"message","id":"03f1e516","parentId":"b69accb1","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:03:46.963Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-11 02:03:13 GMT+8] Feishu[investment] DM from ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0: 做一份今天的收盘报告发给我\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5430978f84a8b2d0b4c6db9c5a1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-11 02:03 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\"\n}\n```\n\n做一份今天的收盘报告发给我"}],"timestamp":1773165826960}}
{"type":"message","id":"279caf8a","parentId":"03f1e516","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:03:57.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求生成今天的A股收盘报告。这涉及到股票数据分析。\n\n根据 AGENTS.md，我有一个 akshare-stock skill 可以用。让我先激活这个 skill 来生成收盘报告。\n\n首先需要检查一下当前的环境和工具。我应该试着使用 akshare 来获取 A 股数据。\n\n根据之前的经验，akshare 模块在本地环境中没有安装。但我可以尝试通过 web 接口获取数据，或者直接告诉用户需要什么信息。\n\n但让我先检查一下能否获取到实时数据。如果不能，我可以提示用户需要提供数据或者使用其他方式。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"好的，为你生成今天的 A 股收盘报告。让我调用 akshare 获取实时行情数据："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01Gh4BDv7zorowJAWeHpf48v","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport sys\ntry:\n    import akshare as ak\n    \n    print(\"📊 A股收盘报告生成中...\\n\")\n    \n    # 获取大盘实时行情\n    index_data = ak.stock_zh_index_spot_sina()\n    \n    # 获取涨跌停统计\n    try:\n        zt = ak.stock_zt_pool_em()\n        zt_count = len(zt) if zt is not None and not zt.empty else 0\n    except:\n        zt_count = 0\n    \n    try:\n        dt = ak.stock_dt_pool_em()\n        dt_count = len(dt) if dt is not None and not dt.empty else 0\n    except:\n        dt_count = 0\n    \n    # 获取资金流向\n    try:\n        money_flow = ak.stock_fund_flow_rank()\n        top5 = money_flow.head(5)\n    except:\n        top5 = None\n    \n    # 生成报告\n    report = \"\"\"╔════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║       📊 A股今日收盘报告              ║\n║          2026-03-11 15:00             ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n【大盘行情】\n\"\"\"\n    \n    for _, row in index_data.iterrows():\n        name = row['name']\n        if name in ['上证指数', '深证成指', '创业板指']:\n            price = row['price']\n            changepercent = row['changepercent']\n            emoji = '📈' if float(changepercent) > 0 else '📉'\n            report += f\"{emoji} {name}: {price:>8} ({changepercent:>7}%)\\n\"\n    \n    report += f\"\"\"\n【统计数据】\n✅ 涨停: {zt_count} 家\n❌ 跌停: {dt_count} 家\n\n\"\"\"\n    \n    if top5 is not None and not top5.empty:\n        report += \"【资金流向TOP5】\\n\"\n        for idx, (_, row) in enumerate(top5.iterrows(), 1):\n            try:\n                name = row['股票简称']\n                flow = row['主力净流入']\n                report += f\"{idx}. {name}: {flow}\\n\"\n            except:\n                pass\n    \n    report += \"\\n💡 数据源: akshare | 实时数据\"\n    \n    print(report)\n    \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"❌ 数据获取失败: {e}\")\n    print(\"\\n需要 akshare 库支持。请使用以下替代方案：\")\n    print(\"1. 手动提供今日大盘数据\")\n    print(\"2. 告诉我关键指标（上证、深证、创业板涨跌幅）\")\n    sys.exit(1)\nEOF\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":1100,"cacheRead":104060,"cacheWrite":2262,"totalTokens":107432,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773165826962}}
