{"type":"message","id":"897ba1c2","parentId":"25b96ef7","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:04:08.045Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"环境缺少 akshare 库。我为你生成一份**模板报告**：\n\n## 📊 A股今日收盘报告\n\n**日期**：2026-03-11  \n**时间**：15:00 收盘  \n**报告生成**：2026-03-11 02:03 GMT+8\n\n---\n\n### 【大盘行情】\n\n我需要你提供今天的关键数据：\n\n📌 **请告诉我以下指标**：\n- 上证指数：今收 ___，涨跌 ___% \n- 深证成指：今收 ___，涨跌 ___% \n- 创业板指：今收 ___，涨跌 ___% \n\n或者：\n- **涨停家数**：___ 家\n- **跌停家数**：___ 家\n- **成交额**：___ 亿元\n\n---\n\n### 解决方案\n\n**方案 A**：你可以：\n1. 在飞书告诉我今天的大盘数据\n2. 我为你整理成完整的收盘报告\n\n**方案 B**：我为你安装 akshare，能自动获取实时数据\n- 需要运行：`pip install akshare`\n\n**你想选哪个方案？** \n\n还是直接给我今天的行情数据，我立即生成报告？📈"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":390,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":107134,"totalTokens":107524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773165837808}}
{"type":"message","id":"9c4a2a05","parentId":"897ba1c2","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:06:46.265Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-11 02:06:46 GMT+8] Feishu[investment] DM from ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0: 做一份今天的收盘报告发给我\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5430a85a3ca0b21267966af2c7d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-11 02:06 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f4000dee777aef171c1d96791c1656d0\"\n}\n```\n\n做一份今天的收盘报告发给我"}],"timestamp":1773166006262}}
{"type":"message","id":"c1f66e47","parentId":"9c4a2a05","timestamp":"2026-03-10T18:06:59.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户重复要求做今天的收盘报告。我之前说需要 akshare 库，现在应该直接安装它并获取数据。让我先安装 akshare，然后生成报告。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_bdrk_01KxBg58C4CDb5Xvu6FRXA2R","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install -q akshare && python3 << 'EOF'\nimport akshare as ak\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nprint(\"📊 正在获取今日收盘数据...\\n\")\n\n# 获取大盘实时行情\ntry:\n    index_data = ak.stock_zh_index_spot_sina()\n    print(\"✅ 大盘行情已获取\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"⚠️ 大盘行情获取失败: {e}\")\n    index_data = None\n\n# 获取涨跌停统计\ntry:\n    zt = ak.stock_zt_pool_em()\n    zt_count = len(zt) if zt is not None and not zt.empty else 0\n    print(f\"✅ 涨停数据已获取: {zt_count} 家\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    zt_count = 0\n    print(f\"⚠️ 涨停数据获取失败\")\n\ntry:\n    dt = ak.stock_dt_pool_em()\n    dt_count = len(dt) if dt is not None and not dt.empty else 0\n    print(f\"✅ 跌停数据已获取: {dt_count} 家\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    dt_count = 0\n    print(f\"⚠️ 跌停数据获取失败\")\n\n# 生成报告\nreport = f\"\"\"╔════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║         📊 A股今日收盘报告                 ║\n║           2026-03-11 (周三)                ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n【主要指数】\n\"\"\"\n\nif index_data is not None and len(index_data) > 0:\n    for _, row in index_data.iterrows():\n        name = row.get('name', '')\n        if name in ['上证指数', '深证成指', '创业板指', '沪深300']:\n            try:\n                price = float(row.get('price', 0))\n                changepercent = float(row.get('changepercent', 0))\n                emoji = '📈' if changepercent > 0 else '📉' if changepercent < 0 else '➡️'\n                report += f\"  {emoji} {name:8} {price:>10.2f}  ({changepercent:>+6.2f}%)\\n\"\n            except:\n                pass\n\nreport += f\"\"\"\n【交易统计】\n  ✅ 涨停: {zt_count:3} 家\n  ❌ 跌停: {dt_count:3} 家\n\n【市场情绪】\n\"\"\"\n\n# 简单的情绪判断\ntotal_up_down = zt_count + dt_count\nif zt_count > dt_count * 3:\n    mood = \"🟢 强势 (涨停远超跌停)\"\nelif zt_count > dt_count:\n    mood = \"🟡 偏强 (涨停大于跌停)\"\nelif dt_count > zt_count:\n    mood = \"🔴 偏弱 (跌停大于涨停)\"\nelse:\n    mood = \"⚪ 平衡\"\n\nreport += f\"  {mood}\\n\"\n\nreport += f\"\"\"\n═════════════════════════════════════════════\n📊 数据源: akshare\n🕒 时间: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\n\"\"\"\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + report)\n\n# 保存报告\nwith open('/tmp/收盘报告_20260311.txt', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(report)\nprint(\"\\n✅ 报告已保存到 /tmp/收盘报告_20260311.txt\")\n\nEOF\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-haiku-4.5","usage":{"input":10,"output":1137,"cacheRead":20944,"cacheWrite":87060,"totalTokens":109151,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773166006263}}
